msgstr "`code_source` in the site's `documentation-manifest.json`"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:0
msgid "本站描述的 checkout、tree、dirty 状态和代码路径"
msgstr ""
"The checkout, tree, dirty status and code paths described by this site"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:0
msgid "当前文档源码"
msgstr "Current documentation source"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:0
msgid "同一 manifest 的 `documentation_source`"
msgstr "`documentation_source` in the same manifest"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:0
msgid "本次正式文档包的精确 commit/tree；不替代预览构建记录"
msgstr ""
"Exact commit/tree for this formal documentation package; not a replacement "
"for preview-build records"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:0
msgid "被引用资格源码"
msgstr "Referenced qualification source"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:0
msgid "schema 2 manifest 的 `qualification_references[]`；每项保存原候选身份与 scope"
msgstr ""
"`qualification_references[]` in the schema 2 manifest; each entry retains "
"its original candidate identity and scope"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:0
msgid "旧的精确代码执行；不是当前代码／文档 HEAD 自动继承的资格"
msgstr ""
"Earlier exact-code execution; no qualification automatically inherited by "
"current code/documentation HEAD"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:27
msgid ""
"成功打包后，公开站点和离线包的 manifest 由实际构建输入生成。Git HEAD 可以因文档提交改变； 这里不手填一个很快漂移的 HEAD "
"常量。未打包的工作树可执行 `git rev-parse HEAD` 核对 checkout，但命令输出本身不是 qualification "
"receipt。"
msgstr ""
"After successful packaging, manifests for the public site and offline "
"package derive from actual build inputs. Documentation commits may change "
"Git HEAD; this page does not manually insert a rapidly drifting HEAD "
"constant. An unpackaged working tree can run `git rev-parse HEAD` to check "
"its checkout, but that command output alone is not a qualification receipt."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:31
msgid ""
"schema 2 不再隐式引用某个历史索引。打包者逐个显式选入原封存候选，工具调用 同一候选 verifier 核对原始闭包后记录 "
"source、configuration、ELF／BIN／map、 qualified scopes "
"与候选文件摘要。没有选入候选时列表为空，不表示软件失败。 文档包离线校验保护这份引用的字节和结构，不重新执行或代替原候选资格校验。 原 locator "
"只说明当时的存储位置，不是公开下载地址。schema 1 历史包保留原 `qualified_code` 的只读校验，不能用它生产新的默认资格引用。"
msgstr ""
"Schema 2 no longer implicitly references a historical index. The packager "
"explicitly selects each original sealed candidate; the tool invokes the same"
" candidate verifier to check its original closure before recording source, "
"configuration, ELF/BIN/map, qualified scopes and the candidate file digest. "
"With no candidate selected, the list is empty; this does not mean software "
"failed. Offline documentation verification protects these reference bytes "
"and structure; it neither reexecutes nor replaces original candidate "
"qualification verification. The original locator identifies its storage "
"location at that time, not a public download URL. Historical schema 1 "
"packages retain read-only verification of their original `qualified_code`; "
"it cannot produce a new default qualification reference."

msgid "最终冷态生命周期交付：7590b2d4"
msgstr "Final cold-lifecycle delivery: 7590b2d4"

msgid "本节描述已完成的封存基线，后续代码与文档提交不自动继承它的资格。平台 `7590b2d457d6042112abb78a4f4df74d613df6ff`，tree `17c18aea10066d5d7418f3a7fd3b42e619ee3414`，已通过 [PR 41](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/41)合入原 `main`，没有另造 源码合并提交。对应外部示例为 `b029cc4b7e8e7a7d3e5e1f1be080a0aa24b1ee09`， 其固定 SDK gitlink 为上述平台提交；[示例 PR 18](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/pull/18) 已合并。示例仓库当前为私有，平台的公开访问权限不包含示例访问权限。"
msgstr "This section describes the completed sealed baseline; later code and documentation commits do not automatically inherit its qualification. Platform `7590b2d457d6042112abb78a4f4df74d613df6ff`, tree `17c18aea10066d5d7418f3a7fd3b42e619ee3414`, was integrated into the then-current `main` through [PR 41](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/41), without creating another source merge commit. The associated external examples source is `b029cc4b7e8e7a7d3e5e1f1be080a0aa24b1ee09`; its SDK gitlink pins that platform commit, and [examples PR 18](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/pull/18) was merged. The examples repository is currently private; public platform access does not include examples access."

msgid "公开的[平台交付索引](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/ecb86832fced0192d620b9029ff2d54795fc6430/docs-platform-delivery-20261029-g7590b2d4/final-index-g7590b2d4.json) 固定于证据提交 `ecb86832fced0192d620b9029ff2d54795fc6430`。 先读取同目录的 `public-recovery-proof.json`：初始 payload 索引保留上传当时的 观察，恢复证明记录其后实际下载、摘要核对和独立恢复的结果，不能把初始 `pending` 当作最终结果。二者均保留原始字节，不相互改写。"
msgstr "The public [platform delivery index](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/ecb86832fced0192d620b9029ff2d54795fc6430/docs-platform-delivery-20261029-g7590b2d4/final-index-g7590b2d4.json) is fixed at evidence commit `ecb86832fced0192d620b9029ff2d54795fc6430`. Read `public-recovery-proof.json` in the same directory first: the initial payload index preserves observations made at upload time, while the recovery proof records subsequent actual downloads, digest checks and independent restorations. Do not interpret an initial `pending` as the final result. Both retain their original bytes and do not rewrite each other."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:0
msgid "范围"
msgstr "Scope"

msgid "实际完成与界限"
msgstr "Actual completion and limits"

msgid "正式软件计划"
msgstr "Formal software plan"

msgid "同一 clean 平台源码的 159 个维护阶段全部实际通过；owned verifier 通过。原执行报告的 `software_qualified=false` 保留，计划通过与候选封存分别判断"
msgstr "All 159 maintained stages actually passed on the same clean platform source, and the owned verifier passed. The original execution report retains `software_qualified=false`; plan execution and candidate sealing are assessed separately."

msgid "Native 四模式"
msgstr "Four Native modes"

msgid "Debug、Release、ASan/UBSan、TSan 各执行 406 项 CTest、386 个 Google 程序、6819 个用例，零失败、错误或跳过；四个工具域共执行 3481 个 Python 用例，不与四模式重复相加"
msgstr "Debug, Release, ASan/UBSan and TSan each executed 406 CTest entries, 386 Google programs and 6819 cases, with no failures, errors or skips. Four tool domains executed 3481 Python cases in total; do not count them again per Native mode."

msgid "静态分析"
msgstr "Static analysis"

msgid "Clang-Tidy 与 Cppcheck 各分析 1135 个不同编译上下文；这是软件分析，不能替代当前源码的 CodeQL 关联或物理测量"
msgstr "Clang-Tidy and Cppcheck each analyzed 1135 distinct compiler contexts. This software analysis does not replace current-source CodeQL association or physical measurement."

msgid "Source SDK"
msgstr "Source SDK"

msgid "50 个独立 consumer root、202 条命令及维护的精确 policy-v11 选择实际通过；53 个完整策略镜像由原计划逐项约束，不能仅凭计数替换选择"
msgstr "50 independent consumer roots, 202 commands and the maintained exact policy-v11 selection actually passed; the original plan constrains all 53 full-policy images individually. A count alone cannot authorize a substituted selection."

msgid "八个软件候选"
msgstr "Eight software candidates"

msgid "H743 HSI64/Cache off、U575 MSIS4/TZEN=0，各取 empty/UART 与裸机/FreeRTOS；16 次 fresh、断网构建及候选封存、校验和恢复完成，不扩大为高级 DMA/Cache/低功耗模式资格"
msgstr "H743 HSI64/Cache off and U575 MSIS4/TZEN=0, each with empty/UART and baremetal/FreeRTOS: 16 fresh network-disabled builds, candidate sealing, verification and recovery completed. This does not qualify advanced DMA, Cache or low-power modes."

msgid "中英文文档"
msgstr "English and Chinese documentation"

msgid "原平台源码的 132 页、264 个语言记录、严格 API/gettext 构建、离线打包和独立恢复完成；文档包没有隐式候选引用，实际 Pages 部署仍未执行"
msgstr "For the original platform source, 132 pages, 264 language records, strict API/gettext builds, offline packaging and independent recovery completed. The documentation package has no implicit candidate references; actual Pages deployment remains unexecuted."

msgid "远程证据恢复"
msgstr "Remote evidence recovery"

msgid "本轮 335 个公开 payload member 的精确提交下载、SHA-256/bytes 核对完成，90 个原归档均独立恢复；原始失败和中断观察仍保留"
msgstr "Exact-commit downloads and SHA-256/byte checks passed for this increment's 335 public payload members, and all 90 original archives were independently restored. Original failed and interrupted observations remain retained."

msgid "候选封存原外层执行会话曾丢失，原外层 receipt 保持 `running/null`；24 个已结束 子命令及后续独立恢复证明各自真实完成。不能补造外层 exit 0，亦不因此丢弃 已经完成的子命令原件。合入主线仅执行身份与固定依赖同步，没有重跑或冒认新的 软件计划、构建或封存。"
msgstr "The original outer candidate-sealing execution session was lost; its original outer receipt remains `running/null`. The 24 terminated child commands and later independent recovery proofs establish their own actual completion. Do not invent an outer exit 0 or discard completed child originals. Main integration only synchronized identities and pinned dependencies; it neither reran nor claimed a new software plan, build or sealing run."

msgid "示例的[授权恢复入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/blob/1baac7b7946a3d71e855e41365972b0781af5291/docs-examples-delivery-20261029-gb029cc4b/recovery-index.json) 固定于私有证据提交 `1baac7b7946a3d71e855e41365972b0781af5291`。使用已有 GitHub 仓库授权读取，不向公开平台归档复制示例源码、私有执行报告或归档。 没有示例权限的读者可使用公开 Source SDK；私有链接无法访问不表示平台恢复失败。"
msgstr "The examples [authenticated recovery entry](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/blob/1baac7b7946a3d71e855e41365972b0781af5291/docs-examples-delivery-20261029-gb029cc4b/recovery-index.json) is fixed at private evidence commit `1baac7b7946a3d71e855e41365972b0781af5291`. Read it using existing GitHub repository authorization; do not copy examples source, private execution reports or archives into public platform artifacts. Readers without examples permission can use the public Source SDK. An inaccessible private link does not indicate platform recovery failure."

msgid "封存时尚未关闭的退出"
msgstr "Exits still open at sealing time"

msgid "工作"
msgstr "Work"

msgid "仍需实际执行的验收"
msgstr "Acceptance that still needs actual execution"

msgid "三板 HIL 与性能"
msgstr "Three-board HIL and performance"

msgid "接入真实 station，执行启动、时钟、UART、DMA、停机、恢复，再测 IRQ 延迟、吞吐、功耗和栈峰值；目前均为 `not_executed`"
msgstr "Connect real stations and execute startup, clock, UART, DMA, stop and recovery, then measure IRQ latency, throughput, power and peak stack use. These are currently all `not_executed`."

msgid "OCI recipe 与新 daemon"
msgstr "OCI recipe and a fresh daemon"

msgid "按锁定 recipe 独立完成两次 fresh 构建，并在新 daemon 实际 load/inspect/run；现有 OCI 字节恢复不建立 recipe 可复现性"
msgstr "Independently complete two fresh builds from the locked recipe and actually load, inspect and run in a fresh daemon. Existing OCI-byte recovery does not establish recipe reproducibility."

msgid "CodeQL、Pages 与服务端规则"
msgstr "CodeQL, Pages and server-side rules"

msgid "取得当前源码的实际 CodeQL 结果及处置，实际部署并核对 Pages，以及服务端回读分支规则；本地门禁不代替这些事实"
msgstr "Obtain and disposition actual current-source CodeQL results, deploy and verify Pages, and read back branch rules from the server. Local gates do not replace these facts."

msgid "高级外部使用路径"
msgstr "Advanced external usage paths"

msgid "7590 基线的 H743 Flash/RAM、U575 retained-time/Stop2 仍需独立外部 recipe；已有 C 机制与 SDK 链接检查不等同于完整使用教程或实板执行"
msgstr "The 7590 baseline still needs independent external recipes for H743 Flash/RAM and U575 retained-time/Stop2. Existing C mechanisms and SDK link checks do not establish a complete usage tutorial or physical execution."

msgid "历史示例证据边界"
msgstr "Historical examples evidence boundary"

msgid "对既有公开示例证据逐项分类后决定保留、迁移或撤回；元数据清单不代表已审查所有归档内容，尚未改写历史"
msgstr "Classify existing public examples evidence before deciding retention, migration or withdrawal. A metadata inventory does not establish review of every archive member; history has not been rewritten."

msgid "正式 Release"
msgstr "Formal Release"

msgid "明确本地 CI 的可信准入并执行发布；不伪造 Actions run，也不把无签名软件候选当作产品发布"
msgstr "Define trusted admission for local CI and actually publish. Do not invent Actions runs or treat an unsigned software candidate as a product release."

msgid "当前 firmware 的硬件算法全部保留在维护的 C11 路径；Python 负责严格配置、静态 对象和固定调用装配。后续迭代优先改进上述使用、交付与实测闭环，不能从这份 封存摘要推导“全系列、全部外设、所有原退出已完成”。"
msgstr "Current firmware hardware algorithms remain in the maintained C11 paths. Python performs strict configuration, static object assembly and fixed call wiring. Subsequent work prioritizes usage, delivery and actual measurement; this sealed summary does not establish whole-family coverage, every peripheral or completion of all original exits."

msgid "后续维护观察：2026-10-30"
msgstr "Subsequent maintenance observations: 2026-10-30"

msgid "本次维护从上述平台和示例基线分支继续。{download}`现有 78 项台账 <../design/platform-delivery-completion.csv>` 只更新已有证据能够证明的状态与索引，并通过原 renderer 派生[可读视图](ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md)。 全部原编号、顺序、退出条件、物理状态、历史 Git 版本、原报告与候选字节保持； 状态分别绑定原受测源码。正式资格仍属 `7590b2d4`，后续开发执行单独记录， 不以新文档 HEAD 覆盖资格源码，不能把该基线的 159 阶段结果重标到新源码。"
msgstr "This maintenance continues on branches from the platform and examples baselines above. The existing {download}`78-task ledger <../design/platform-delivery-completion.csv>` updates only statuses and indexes proved by existing evidence, and the original renderer derives its [readable view](ledgers/platform-delivery-completion.md). All original IDs, ordering, exit conditions, physical statuses, historical Git versions, original reports and candidate bytes are preserved. Statuses bind their original tested sources separately. Formal qualification still belongs to `7590b2d4`; subsequent development executions are recorded separately. A new documentation HEAD does not replace qualified source or relabel that baseline's 159-stage result as qualification of new source."

msgid "平台增量 `dee8be5bb1052442a7853cf792b3fd589e17a9c9` 的普通完整索引门禁 实际通过：3565 个 Python 用例（testing 1755、configure 1156、CI 493、workflows 161），以及 386 个 Google 程序、6819 个用例，零失败或跳过。这是该提交的开发 门禁，不是新的完整 159 阶段正式资格，也不扩大旧候选范围。"
msgstr "Platform increment `dee8be5bb1052442a7853cf792b3fd589e17a9c9` actually passed its ordinary complete-index gate: 3565 Python cases (1755 testing, 1156 configure, 493 CI and 161 workflows), plus 386 Google programs and 6819 cases, with no failures or skips. This is development-gate execution for that commit, not a new complete 159-stage formal qualification or an expansion of old candidate scope."

msgid "私有示例后续提交 `ac9f07ba7494f472144f37660aabbd4185710394`（[PR 19](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/pull/19)） 与 `5fb06175aab72292fb075e8a9ea67096203a86dc`（[PR 20](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/pull/20)） 均已合并；示例当前主线为后者，SDK gitlink 仍固定已验证的 `7590b2d4`。最后普通 门禁实际通过 85 个 Python 用例、21 项 CTest、12 个 Google 程序和 129 个用例， 零跳过。H743 Flash/RAM 和 U575 retained WUT、SRAM4 copy、LPTIM1 单组 LPBAM 已有独立工程、实际 ARM 链接与资源检查；H743 的 RAM 执行闭包亦经审核。这补齐 E04 当前维护的选定高级 recipe，属于软件开发执行，不代表 HIL、通用 LPBAM、 新平台正式资格或新的软件候选。"
msgstr "Subsequent private examples commits `ac9f07ba7494f472144f37660aabbd4185710394` ([PR 19](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/pull/19)) and `5fb06175aab72292fb075e8a9ea67096203a86dc` ([PR 20](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/pull/20)) were both merged. Current examples main is the latter, while the SDK gitlink still pins verified `7590b2d4`. The final ordinary gate actually passed 85 Python cases, 21 CTest entries, 12 Google programs and 129 cases, with no skips. Independent projects, actual ARM links and resource checks now exist for H743 Flash/RAM and U575 retained WUT, SRAM4 copy and single-tuple LPTIM1 LPBAM; the H743 RAM execution closure was also audited. This completes E04's currently maintained selected advanced recipes as software development execution. It does not establish HIL, general LPBAM, new platform formal qualification or a new software candidate."

msgid "初始 LPTIM 草稿早于对应测试的事实已在 PR 20 披露；后续真实 RED → GREEN 修复保留原执行。不用重建的源码补造早期测试顺序。并行 TDD 现要求测试 owner 先保留实际 RED、源码与二进制，再释放实现 owner 的交接屏障。"
msgstr "The initial LPTIM draft preceded its corresponding tests, as disclosed in PR 20; later genuine RED-to-GREEN fixes retain their original execution. Reconstructed source is not used to invent earlier test chronology. Parallel TDD now requires the test owner to retain actual RED, source and binary before releasing the implementation owner's handoff barrier."

msgid "退出"
msgstr "Exit"

msgid "本次实际观察"
msgstr "Actual observation in this maintenance"

msgid "GitHub 分支规则"
msgstr "GitHub branch rules"

msgid "写入仍返回 HTTP 403 `Resource not accessible by integration`；规则回读为空，不能声称保护已启用"
msgstr "Writing still returns HTTP 403 `Resource not accessible by integration`; rule readback is empty. Protection cannot be claimed as enabled."

msgid "CodeQL 关联"
msgstr "CodeQL association"

msgid "当前 API 读取返回 HTTP 403；未取得可处置的当前源码扫描结果"
msgstr "The current API read returns HTTP 403; current-source scan results have not been obtained for disposition."

msgid "Pages 部署"
msgstr "Pages deployment"

msgid "尚未实际部署；本地 HTML 和归档恢复不代替远端站点核对"
msgstr "Not actually deployed. Local HTML and archive recovery do not replace remote-site verification."

msgid "OCI 重建与新 daemon"
msgstr "OCI rebuilds and a fresh daemon"

msgid "可用容量未满足既有准备估算，尚未启动两次 fresh recipe 构建或新 daemon 执行；旧 OCI 字节身份及不等价边界保留"
msgstr "Available capacity does not meet the existing preparation estimate. Two fresh recipe builds and fresh-daemon execution have not started. The existing OCI byte identity and non-equivalence boundary remain unchanged."

msgid "首发三板工装"
msgstr "Launch-board tooling for three boards"

msgid "三板 prepare 与 measurement plan 共六条 CLI 实际返回 0，状态仍为 `prepared_unbound`；实板采集和性能测量均未执行"
msgstr "Three-board prepare and measurement-plan operations completed six actual CLI commands with exit 0; status remains `prepared_unbound`. Physical acquisition and performance measurements have not executed."

msgid "历史发布边界"
msgstr "Historical publication boundary"

