msgid "历史发布边界的实际处置见[公开撤下说明](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/d14d093879362d6a1796ee9e0d47f75f793e5135/docs-asset-retention-20261030/WITHDRAWAL.md)。 私有留存的[授权恢复索引](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/blob/8aa825c7d2cd8f58f4fa84869f16700aea400783/docs-legacy-examples-retention-20261030/retention-index.json) 固定于 `8aa825c7d2cd8f58f4fa84869f16700aea400783`。本次正常 hook、非强制推送、 精确提交回读与成员核对已执行；未改写旧提交，不把当前 tip 撤下称作历史擦除。 当前 `7590b2d4` 平台恢复证明与示例私有 `1baac7b7` 入口仍保持原身份。"
msgstr "Actual historical-boundary mitigation is recorded in the [public withdrawal notice](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/d14d093879362d6a1796ee9e0d47f75f793e5135/docs-asset-retention-20261030/WITHDRAWAL.md). The private retention [authenticated recovery index](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples/blob/8aa825c7d2cd8f58f4fa84869f16700aea400783/docs-legacy-examples-retention-20261030/retention-index.json) is fixed at `8aa825c7d2cd8f58f4fa84869f16700aea400783`. Ordinary hooks, non-force pushes, exact-commit readback and member checks actually ran. Old commits were not rewritten; withdrawal from the current tip is not historical erasure. The current `7590b2d4` platform recovery proof and private examples `1baac7b7` entry retain their original identities."

msgid "F04 的结论保留原审查的合同／oracle 映射层级，不扩大为全项目每个历史用例 均已人工证明语义独立。真实硬件、完整受控 cold/warm 对比与环境重建等原退出 仍由同一台账保留，不能因完整软件计划已通过而批量改成完成。"
msgstr "F04 retains the original review's contract/oracle mapping level; it does not claim that every historical project case was manually proved semantically independent. The same ledger preserves original exits for real hardware, complete controlled cold/warm comparison and environment reconstruction. A complete software-plan pass cannot change all of them to completed."

