msgid "N2/E1 的原本地候选导航分别记录在外部示例仓库的 `build/controlled-dependencies-ce616ea9/delivery-index.json` 和 `build/documentation-controlled-dependencies-ce616ea9/delivery-index.json`。 前者定位原候选、产物与可移植证据；后者定位双语文档包和独立离线恢复记录， 文档发布仍为 `published=false`。这些路径是原主机留存位置，不是公开下载 URL。 Nexus 合并提交 `3ea252c6` 与受测 N2 的 Git tree 相同，示例合并提交 `4a9f5f75` 与受测 E1 的 Git tree 相同；关联保留原受测提交，不改写候选源码。本次后续 C 生命周期增量中，`194ca6cb` 已完成其精确源码的 SDK 消费与严格双语文档交付； `d21dfcab` 已完成其普通完整索引门禁。该索引中的后续 pending 字段属于当时的 开发观察；最终 `7590b2d4` 的门禁、SDK、示例、文档、双构建与封存见本页前节。 各家族开发计数不可相加，也不覆盖四种 Native 模式或实板验收。"
msgstr "The original N2/E1 local candidate navigation is recorded in the external examples repository at `build/controlled-dependencies-ce616ea9/delivery-index.json` and `build/documentation-controlled-dependencies-ce616ea9/delivery-index.json`. The former locates original candidates, artifacts and portable evidence; the latter locates bilingual documentation packages and independent offline recovery records. Documentation publication remains `published=false`. These are original host locations, not public download URLs. Nexus merge commit `3ea252c6` has the same Git tree as tested N2, and examples merge commit `4a9f5f75` has the same Git tree as tested E1; the association retains the tested source without rewriting candidates. In the later C lifecycle increment, `194ca6cb` completed exact-source SDK consumption and strict bilingual documentation delivery; `d21dfcab` completed its ordinary complete-index gate. Later pending fields in that index are development observations from their original time. Final gates, SDK, examples, documentation, dual builds and sealing for `7590b2d4` are described earlier on this page. Family development counts must not be added together or treated as coverage of all four Native modes or physical acceptance."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:63
msgid ""
"各索引保留原 schema、范围、失败尝试、receipt、归档和 member 身份，不能相加 测试次数、ARM "
"镜像数或任务数量，也不能据此计算全项目完成率。后续文档 commit 只记录这些基线。当前文档的检查、渲染、离线恢复与部署验证各自有独立记录。"
msgstr ""
"Each index preserves its original schema, scope, failed attempts, receipts, "
"archive and member identities. Do not add test counts, ARM images or task "
"counts, or calculate a project-wide completion rate. Later documentation "
"commits only record these baselines. Current documentation checks, "
"rendering, offline recovery and deployment have their own records."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/software-verification.md:67
msgid ""
"构建系统记录没有执行一次完整 72-stage 软件总计划，也没有执行 OCI recipe 重建、 CP311 离线安装、Windows/macOS "
"集成或 MCU HIL。独立执行过的具体 scopes 按原索引 解释；不要从其 aggregate 状态扩大结论。其八个无签名软件候选是 H743 "
"HSI64／ Cache off 和 U575 MSIS4／TZEN=0 的 empty／UART、裸机／FreeRTOS 组合。"
msgstr ""
"The build-system record did not execute one complete 72-stage software plan,"
" an OCI recipe rebuild, CP311 offline installation, Windows/macOS "
"integration or MCU HIL. Interpret separately executed scopes through the "
"original index rather than expanding an aggregate status. Its eight unsigned"
" software candidates are H743 HSI64/Cache-off and U575 MSIS4/TZEN=0 "
"empty/UART baremetal/FreeRTOS combinations."

