msgid "私有示例的旧基线 `2e932bbc`（PR 24）固定 SDK `7fd36f8a`，其普通门禁为 86 个 Python 用例、23 项 CTest、13 个 Google 程序和 146 个用例。后续已接受 私有开发提交 `ff86eb49` 固定公共 SDK `6c3a380a`；其普通门禁为 89 个 Python 用例、28 项 CTest、18 个 Google 程序和 204 个用例，source 与 installed 各执行 五个真实 broker 场景，均零失败或跳过。该私有范围与公共 `eb4aba66`／v15 分开。 早期 peer 11、main 4、broker 5 和 24 个文件 style 检查保留原源码范围，不与 新执行相加。公开平台仅记录聚合与提交／PR 元数据，私有源码、payload 路径、 receipt 和归档保持私有；当时 PR 24 仍为 draft。"
msgstr "The earlier private examples baseline `2e932bbc` (PR 24) pins SDK `7fd36f8a`; its ordinary gate has 86 Python cases, 23 CTest tests, 13 Google programs and 146 cases. Later accepted private development commit `ff86eb49` pins public SDK `6c3a380a`; its ordinary gate has 89 Python cases, 28 CTest tests, 18 Google programs and 204 cases, and source and installed builds each ran five real-broker scenarios, all with zero failures or skips. This private scope is separate from public `eb4aba66`/v15. Earlier 11 peer cases, 4 main cases, 5 broker cases and style checks on 24 files retain their original source scopes and are not added to the new executions. The public platform records only aggregates and commit/PR metadata; private source, payload paths, receipts and archives remain private. PR 24 was a draft at that time."

