msgid "本轮软件资格固定公共源码 `ab53225033dfb759e93c90beb6301a3048bbcfda`，tree `2309ae92e019fac68c6f463cbee205c3726fe73d`，23 个公共依赖 clean。普通完整索引 门禁实际通过 420 个 Google 程序、7342 个用例和四个工具域合计 3964 个用例， 零失败、错误或跳过。两次独立完整 159 阶段计划均实际通过；每种 Native 模式各 420 程序／7342 用例／440 项 CTest，四模式计数不相加。tidy、cppcheck 各保留 1193 个编译上下文／1303 个自有 TU，实际返回 0。"
msgstr "Software qualification for this round is fixed to public source `ab53225033dfb759e93c90beb6301a3048bbcfda`, tree `2309ae92e019fac68c6f463cbee205c3726fe73d`, with 23 clean public dependencies. The ordinary complete-index gate passed 420 Google programs, 7342 cases and 3964 cases across four tool domains, with zero failures, errors or skips. Two independent complete 159-stage plans actually passed; each Native mode had 420 programs / 7342 cases / 440 CTest registrations, and counts across the four modes are not added. Both tidy and cppcheck retained 1193 compiler contexts / 1303 owned TUs and returned 0."

msgid "SDK v15 的 64 个 root／67 个镜像／270 条命令及独立验证通过。H743／U575 × baremetal／FreeRTOS × empty／UART 的 8 个候选完成 16 次 fresh 断网构建， 各对 ELF／BIN 逐字节一致，seal、实际恢复和恢复后复核通过。四个 UART 的 HIL 仅为 `prepared_unbound`。精确 P2 严格文档完成 132 个 canonical 页面、264 条 reviewed 记录，Doxygen／gettext／EN／ZH、官方包及实际恢复复核均通过。"
msgstr "SDK v15 passed 64 roots / 67 images / 270 commands and independent verification. The eight H743/U575 × baremetal/FreeRTOS × empty/UART candidates completed 16 fresh network-disabled builds, with byte-identical ELF/BIN for each pair, successful sealing, actual restoration and restored verification. HIL for the four UART profiles is only `prepared_unbound`. Strict documentation for exact P2 completed 132 canonical pages and 264 reviewed records; Doxygen/gettext/EN/ZH, the official package and its actual restored verification all passed."

msgid "同 P2、工具和环境的完整计划比较保留每阶段原始成本与失败诊断。baseline／repeat 的阶段耗时累计分别为 6742.878869825／6387.338375682 秒，attempt interval-union 分别为 6742.710856041／6387.179537077 秒；它们是不同口径。最大观测进程 RSS 为 730820608／730624000 B，不能当作并发进程树峰值。缓存复用和存储迁位使本轮 比较属于 observational，`fresh_cold` 与 `controlled_causal_speedup` 均为 false。 F01 的 157 项同名检查及两个新增工具域、三个仅退休注册的原用例映射均保留。 N09 另有同一 CodeQL trace 内实际 fresh build directory configure/build 与 warm configure/build，四份 compilation database 的 2642 条记录相同，warm 实际执行 15 次 compile／10 次 link；这不关闭其他 MCU、CLI 或 F05 的独立退出条件。"
msgstr "The complete-plan comparison on the same P2, tools and environment retains original per-stage costs and failure diagnostics. Baseline/repeat cumulative stage durations were 6742.878869825/6387.338375682 seconds, while attempt interval-unions were 6742.710856041/6387.179537077 seconds; these are different measures. Maximum observed process RSS was 730820608/730624000 B, not a simultaneous process-tree peak. Cache reuse and storage relocation make this comparison observational; `fresh_cold` and `controlled_causal_speedup` are both false. F01 retains 157 same-name checks, two added tool domains and the original case mappings for three retired registrations. N09 also has actual fresh-build-directory configure/build and warm configure/build within the same CodeQL trace. All four compilation databases have identical 2642 records, and the warm build actually compiled 15 times and linked 10 times; this does not close independent exits for other MCUs, CLI or F05."

msgid "无签名公开交付从[固定的 12 片传输描述](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/71b4f0e4cc9168e708513fb647b903c4bb39c71e/docs-public-p2-ab532250-20261104/transport.json) 取得。它绑定 401386855 B 的 outer archive；已独立 join、实际恢复 6657 个文件／ 433814378 B，恢复当时，由同一 producer 及当时仍存活的资格产物执行 `verify-local` 通过。 先读恢复后的 `local-release.json` 查 archive/member 和原证据身份。远端包不含 全部 Native binary／object；42＋4 个本地 stores／fullindexes 保留完整可恢复 bytes／mode，不声明远端 Native 字节重建或自动重放原路径／nsmtime。 它为 `unsigned`、`local_observation_no_oidc`，未建立产品 Release、签名、hosted CI 或实板资格。"
msgstr "The unsigned public delivery is obtained through the [pinned 12-part transport descriptor](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/71b4f0e4cc9168e708513fb647b903c4bb39c71e/docs-public-p2-ab532250-20261104/transport.json). It binds a 401386855 B outer archive; an independent join actually restored 6657 files / 433814378 B. At recovery time, the same producer and qualification artifacts that were still live then passed `verify-local`. Read the restored `local-release.json` first for archive/member mappings and original evidence identities. The remote package does not contain all Native binaries/objects; 42+4 local stores/fullindexes retain complete recoverable bytes/modes. No remote Native byte reconstruction or automatic replay of original paths/nsmtime is claimed. It is `unsigned` and `local_observation_no_oidc`, and establishes no product Release, signatures, hosted CI or physical-board qualification."

msgid "P2 Python 实际完成 174 个 query、45 条 finding 逐项处置。C++ 完成同一不可变 输入的跨 attempt 组合分析：109 项经完整解码验证的既有结果与 74 项实际补算， 随后 fresh full-suite interpret 返回 0；183 个 query 一一覆盖，1234 条原 finding 均逐项审查，无缺漏或重复。这不是单次 fresh 183，也不是零缺陷结果。原 OOM、 timeout 和取消尝试保留失败；Python／C++ DB 的 native 与 portable 实际恢复、 派生展开退休及临时 Native／TMP 回填分别保留收条，早期 live 字段不作当前存活声明。"
msgstr "P2 Python actually completed 174 queries, with all 45 findings individually reviewed. C++ completed a cross-attempt analysis on the same immutable inputs: 109 existing results validated by full decoding plus 74 actual additional evaluations, followed by a fresh full-suite interpretation returning 0. All 183 queries map one-to-one, and all 1234 original findings were individually reviewed without missing or duplicate entries. This is neither a single fresh 183-query run nor a finding-free result. Original OOM, timeout and cancelled attempts remain failed. Native and portable restoration of the Python/C++ databases, retirement of derived expansions and restoration of temporarily relocated Native/TMP evidence have separate receipts; early live fields are not current-live assertions."

msgid "真实发现的 Python FD 失败路径、GoogleTest `RE` 复制赋值及 lwIP fixture fatal assertion 清理问题均有实际 RED／GREEN。机器依赖清单还修复了 official upstream base 与 selected organization patch 的混淆。独立 QA 后续提交为 `706ee80b12a653a1820685c530b21e9668d82064`，tree `5c39d9cfce75ed33354a13e1329c6e668b0463d2`；13-path 普通完整索引门禁通过 420 个 Google 程序／7342 个用例和 3968 个工具用例，零失败、错误或跳过。 其 GoogleTest pin 为官方 1.16.0 基线 `6910c9d9` 上的组织补丁 `58ec32c0`。 该新 SHA 已重新提取 Python DB 并实际完成全部 174 个 query：create／analyze 分别为 36.224848／96.868403 秒，均返回 0。38 条 finding 为 30 note／6 warning／ 2 error；七条旧 finding 消失，其中两条为真实 FD 失败路径修复、五条为等价清理， 无新增或歧义匹配。剩余38条唯一对应原已审处置：其中36项所在源码的 blob 未变，两条变更文件 中的 survivor 已独立重读；两条 error 仍保留原严重度及准确源码身份的 Root 误报处置， 不称为零 error／零 finding。固件、C++ 分析、SDK、8 个候选和两次完整159保留 P2 身份，不转移资格；本轮未重跑第三次159。"
msgstr "Actual RED/GREEN evidence covers the Python FD failure paths, GoogleTest `RE` copy assignment and lwIP fixture fatal-assertion cleanup defects. Machine dependency inventory also corrected confusion between the official upstream base and selected organization patch. The independent QA followup commit is `706ee80b12a653a1820685c530b21e9668d82064`, tree `5c39d9cfce75ed33354a13e1329c6e668b0463d2`; its 13-path ordinary complete-index gate passed 420 Google programs / 7342 cases and 3968 tool cases, with zero failures, errors or skips. Its GoogleTest pin is organization patch `58ec32c0` on official version 1.16.0 base `6910c9d9`. A new Python database was extracted for this SHA and all 174 queries actually completed: create/analyze took 36.224848/96.868403 seconds and both returned 0. The 38 findings comprise 30 notes / 6 warnings / 2 errors. Seven old findings disappeared: two actual FD failure-path defects and five equivalent cleanups, with no new or ambiguous matches. All 38 survivors uniquely map to previously reviewed dispositions: 36 findings have unchanged source blobs, and the two survivors in changed files were independently reread. The two errors retain their raw severity and Root false-positive dispositions bound to the exact source identities; this is not a zero-error or finding-free result. Firmware, C++ analysis, SDK, eight candidates and both complete 159-stage runs retain their P2 identities without transferring qualification; no third 159-stage run was performed in this round."

msgid "当前私有 E 固定 `f59debf1a15913353462e69ba0039db1c010f284`，平台 pin 为 P2 `ab532250`。完整 17 presets／116 条维护 CI 命令均返回 0，Native 为 28 项 CTest／ 18 个 Google 程序／204 用例，installed 为 2 项 CTest；各域不相加。source 与 installed 各五个真实 C broker 场景通过，deadline 的 exit code 4、缺 client certificate 的 exit code 6 均为预期拒绝，join／release／cleanup 实际闭合。三个 usage recipes 由本次 完整执行覆盖；公共安装版 SDK walk 完成 12 条命令及 1 项 CTest，SDK payload 与 origin 均未变。私有应用源码、payload 与原始日志保持私有，仅公开批准的聚合数据； broker helper 的 `qualification=false` 保留，真实 C 用例与所有权清理另行核验。 首次 source broker 的 Docker bridge 环境失败保留，恢复原 docker0 后原维护 bridge 合同实际通过；不改写首失败。E 已在认证确认仓库为 private 后，正常 nonforce push 并精确读回同一 `f59debf1`； private main 未更新，物理仍未执行。"
msgstr "Current private E is fixed to `f59debf1a15913353462e69ba0039db1c010f284`, with platform pin P2 `ab532250`. All 17 presets / 116 maintained CI commands returned 0. Native execution had 28 CTest tests / 18 Google programs / 204 cases, and installed execution had 2 CTest tests; counts across domains are not added. Source and installed builds each passed five real C broker scenarios. Exit code 4 for a deadline and exit code 6 for a missing client certificate were expected rejections, with join/release/cleanup actually completed. Three usage recipes were covered by this complete execution. The public installed-SDK walk completed 12 commands and 1 CTest test, with SDK payload and origin unchanged. Private application source, payloads and original logs remain private; only approved aggregates are public. The broker helper retains `qualification=false`; actual C cases and ownership cleanup were checked separately. The first source-broker Docker bridge environment failure is preserved. After restoring the original docker0, the existing maintained bridge contract actually passed; the first failure was not rewritten. After authenticated confirmation that the repository is private, E completed a normal nonforce push and exact readback of the same `f59debf1`. Private main is unchanged, and physical execution remains unperformed."

